This modular multiplication module MUST match the following interface exactly (it will be a drop-in replacement for the reference `modmul.v`):

```verilog
module modmul(
    input         clk, rst,   // active-HIGH reset
    input  [11:0] A, B,       // operands in [0, 3328]
